<section class="g-section" style="padding-top:170px;padding-bottom:120px;">
  <div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;">
    <p class="g-eyebrow">The House</p>
    <h1 class="g-h2">Care &amp; Policies</h1>
    <p class="g-intro">Plain answers, given the way we would across the kitchen table.</p>

    <nav class="g-polnav" style="margin-top:36px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;" aria-label="Policy sections">
      <a href="#shipping" class="g-btn-outline" style="font-size:11px;padding:8px 18px;">I &middot; Shipping</a>
