    <article id="shipping" class="g-policy" style="scroll-margin-top:130px;margin-top:72px;">
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--bronze);letter-spacing:0.2em;">I</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);font-size:30px;margin:10px 0 0;">Shipping</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--ivory);font-size:16px;margin:10px 0 0;">Made with care, delivered with patience.</p>
      <span style="display:block;height:1px;width:48px;background:var(--gold);margin:24px 0 8px;"></span>
      <div class="g-policy__body"><p>Every GORONY piece is prepared with care, many made to order. Please allow <strong>2&ndash;5 business days</strong> for your order to be produced and packed before it ships.</p>
<p>Once shipped, delivery within the United States typically takes <strong>5&ndash;10 business days</strong>. You will receive a confirmation email with tracking the moment your order leaves our hands.</p>
<h3>Processing</h3>
<p>Orders are processed Monday through Friday. Orders placed on weekends or holidays begin processing the next business day.</p>
<h3>Shipping rates</h3>
<p>Shipping is calculated at checkout based on your address and order.</p>
<h3>Delays</h3>
<p>Occasionally, carriers experience delays beyond our control. If your order has not arrived within 15 business days of your shipping confirmation, write to us at <a href="mailto:Sinahgh16@gmail.com">Sinahgh16@gmail.com</a> and we will make it right.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article id="returns" class="g-policy" style="scroll-margin-top:130px;margin-top:72px;">
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--bronze);letter-spacing:0.2em;">II</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);font-size:30px;margin:10px 0 0;">Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--ivory);font-size:16px;margin:10px 0 0;">If it is not right, we make it right.</p>
      <span style="display:block;height:1px;width:48px;background:var(--gold);margin:24px 0 8px;"></span>
      <div class="g-policy__body"><p>We want every piece to earn its place on your shelf. If something is not right, we will make it right.</p>
<h3>Returns</h3>
<p>Unopened, unused products in their original packaging may be returned within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery for a full refund. For reasons of hygiene and safety, we cannot accept returns of opened or used cosmetics &mdash; this protects every customer.</p>
<h3>Damaged or incorrect orders</h3>
<p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect, email us within 7 days of delivery with a photo and your order number. We will replace it or refund you in full &mdash; no return shipping required.</p>
<h3>How to start a return</h3>
<p>Write to <a href="mailto:Sinahgh16@gmail.com">Sinahgh16@gmail.com</a> with your order number. We will reply with instructions within 1&ndash;2 business days. Refunds are issued to your original payment method within 5&ndash;10 business days of our receipt of the return.</p>
<h3>Sale items</h3>
<p>Discounted items follow the same policy unless marked final sale.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article id="privacy" class="g-policy" style="scroll-margin-top:130px;margin-top:72px;">
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--bronze);letter-spacing:0.2em;">III</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);font-size:30px;margin:10px 0 0;">Privacy</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--ivory);font-size:16px;margin:10px 0 0;">Your trust is part of the house.</p>
      <span style="display:block;height:1px;width:48px;background:var(--gold);margin:24px 0 8px;"></span>
      <div class="g-policy__body"><p>GORONY respects the women who trust us. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it.</p>
<h3>What we collect</h3>
<p>When you place an order or join our list, we collect the information needed to serve you: your name, email, shipping address, and order details. Payment details are processed securely by Shopify Payments and its partners &mdash; GORONY never sees or stores your card numbers.</p>
<h3>How we use it</h3>
<p>To fulfill your orders, send order updates, and &mdash; if you have joined our list &mdash; the occasional letter from the house. You can unsubscribe at any time with one click.</p>
<h3>What we never do</h3>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with the services that operate our store: Shopify (our platform), our fulfillment partners (to ship your order), and payment processors.</p>
<h3>Cookies</h3>
<p>Our site uses cookies to keep your bag working and understand how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>
<h3>Your rights</h3>
<p>You may request a copy or deletion of your personal data at any time by writing to <a href="mailto:Sinahgh16@gmail.com">Sinahgh16@gmail.com</a>.</p></div>
    </article>
    <article id="terms" class="g-policy" style="scroll-margin-top:130px;margin-top:72px;">
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--bronze);letter-spacing:0.2em;">IV</p>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-weight:500;color:var(--gold);font-size:30px;margin:10px 0 0;">Terms of Service</h2>
      <p style="font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--ivory);font-size:16px;margin:10px 0 0;">The simple rules of the house.</p>
      <span style="display:block;height:1px;width:48px;background:var(--gold);margin:24px 0 8px;"></span>
      <div class="g-policy__body"><p>Welcome to GORONY. By using this site and placing an order, you agree to these terms.</p>
<h3>Products</h3>
<p>We describe every piece as accurately as we can. Colors may vary slightly by screen. Our products are cosmetic products for external use; review ingredient lists before use if you have sensitivities, and discontinue use if irritation occurs.</p>
<h3>Orders and payment</h3>
<p>All prices are in USD. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel an order in cases of suspected fraud or pricing error; you will always be refunded in full if we cancel.</p>
<h3>Shipping and returns</h3>
<p>See our Shipping Policy and Refund Policy, which form part of these terms.</p>
<h3>Intellectual property</h3>
<p>The GORONY name, crest, imagery, and site content belong to GORONY and may not be used without permission.</p>
<h3>Limitation of liability</h3>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, GORONY&rsquo;s liability for any claim related to an order is limited to the amount you paid for that order.</p>
<h3>Contact</h3>
<p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:Sinahgh16@gmail.com">Sinahgh16@gmail.com</a>.</p></div>
    </article>
